---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact & Orders — Made in China Peptide" description="Orders are placed by contacting our sales team directly. Send your product list, quantities and destination by email or WhatsApp; we confirm availability, pricing, documentation and lead time within one business day." canonical="/contact/">
  <div class="wrap-narrow">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> › Contact</p>
    <h1>Contact us to place an order</h1>
    <p class="lead muted">We do not use an online checkout. Orders are placed directly with our sales team so that availability, documentation, pricing tier and destination requirements are confirmed before payment.</p>

    <h2>How to order</h2>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Send your requirement</strong> — product names and strengths, quantity per SKU, destination country, and any documentation you need.</li>
      <li><strong>Receive confirmation</strong> — we reply within one business day with availability, price tier, lead time and the batch documentation package.</li>
      <li><strong>Review the documents</strong> — check the sample COA (HPLC chromatogram and MS confirmation) before committing.</li>
      <li><strong>Confirm and pay</strong> — once terms are agreed, we schedule production and prepare the export documents.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>What to include in your message</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Products and strengths (an SKU list is ideal)</li>
      <li>Quantity per SKU</li>
      <li>Destination country</li>
      <li>Documentation needs (COA, HPLC, MS, MSDS, specification sheet, custom label)</li>
      <li>Buyer type: laboratory, distributor, brand/OEM</li>
      <li>Required delivery window, if any</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Contact channels</h2>
    <p><a class="wa-btn" href={site.whatsappLink} target="_blank" rel="noopener">💬 Chat on WhatsApp</a></p>
    <table>
      <tbody>
        <tr><th style="width:180px;">Sales</th><td><a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></td></tr>
        <tr><th>Martin</th><td><a href="mailto:martin@madeinchinapeptide.com">martin@madeinchinapeptide.com</a></td></tr>
        <tr><th>Administration</th><td><a href="mailto:admin@madeinchinapeptide.com">admin@madeinchinapeptide.com</a></td></tr>
        <tr><th>WhatsApp</th><td><a class="wa-btn" href={site.whatsappLink} target="_blank" rel="noopener">💬 WhatsApp</a></td></tr>
        <tr><th>Response time</th><td>Within 1 business day (Mon–Sat, UTC+8)</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="note" style="margin-top:24px;">We only supply business buyers. Requests that indicate personal human use will be declined.</div>

    <h2>Before you write</h2>
    <p>If you are comparing suppliers, the <a href="/knowledge/china-peptide-sourcing-framework/">sourcing framework</a> lists the five checks that matter. If you already have a supplier and need a second source, the <a href="/knowledge/second-peptide-supplier-qualification/">second-supplier qualification guide</a> explains the sample and documentation sequence.</p>

    <div class="ruo" style="margin-top:20px;">{site.ruo}</div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
